/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
# Written at render time (tables, TikZ) or by `make analyze` (figures).
/assets/
comment.cut
# Private material must never be tracked, wherever it lands. The repo-wide
# `!data/**/*.json` re-include would otherwise pick up a misplaced key or
# canary file; office and PDF files belong under the ignored raw/ folder.
data/**/*.xlsx
data/**/*.docx
data/**/*.pdf
**/KEY*.json
**/*canary*
.pilot.local.json
# Owner's plain-language explainer: local only unless the owner adds it.
EXPLAINED_SIMPLY.md
